{"data":{"content":"\"\"\"Lab 0: Getting Started.\"\"\"\n\n\ndef twenty_twenty_six():\n    \"\"\"Come up with the most creative expression that evaluates to 2026\n    using only numbers and the +, *, and - operators (or ** and % if you'd like).\n\n    >>> twenty_twenty_six()\n    2026\n    \"\"\"\n    return 10 + 2000 + 16\n","line_count":12,"path":"lab00.py","sha256":"e320f44d832282536786c00313d8a225dc668d2f7b0abf0394010268d9641a58"},"hash":"8bb738faa4a3d14cf076e11bae7befbab40cd32ef03d3771a7725d1425d5c581","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"d5bbf7e90de9e95e0800680e9ef6a7e989ca29a8a32db574c4509a9bfafc81db","seq":547,"t":59551183,"wall":"2026-09-09T18:27:08.595Z"}
